    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nOpen Viewings from 11am to 1pm on Sunday the 4th of October 2026. \n\nWelcome to WestPoint, Donegal Town - Where Luxury & Style meets unrivalled Quality..\n\nShowhouse Details: \nEircode for Showhouse - House No 102 -F94 E5RC.\n\nWestPoint is an exclusive development of exceptional A2-rated luxury Homes comprising a collection of state-of-the-art NZEB-compliant 4-bed detached homes.\n\nThese elegant new homes have been thoughtfully designed in a layout to provide spacious accommodation for modern-day living, with a well above average finish, featuring extensive glazing resulting in naturally bright homes. All houses feature an advanced Air-to-Water heat pump providing thermostatically controlled underfloor heating to the ground floor together with high-output radiators to the first floor, plus high levels of insulation resulting in reduced energy demand for cleaner, healthier living. \n\nAs standard, these stunning new homes also include modern high-gloss kitchen units finished in stunning white quartz worktops. High-end appliances are included as standard, featuring a top-of-range Neff high-top oven and hotplate together with an integrated dishwasher and fridge/freezer. \n\nLuxury comes as standard in these exceptional homes, you will note the attention to detail featuring carefully selected fixtures and fittings giving outstanding finishes throughout.\n\nHELP TO BUY:\nHomes in this development qualify for both the Help to Buy Scheme. \n\nDIRECTIONS:\nPlease review map attached below or input eircode into Google Maps to obtain Streetview (if available). \n\nVIEWING DETAILS: \nDNG Dorrian strives to be flexible around property viewings. To arrange a viewing outside the designated open days or discuss any of the WestPoint houses, call Rory on 087 6394003."
      },
